#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:2
msgid "Manage your mobile notifications"
msgstr "모바일 알림 관리"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr ""
"|plans-img-yellow| `Entry, Professional, Enterprise 및 Enterprise Advanced "
"플랜 <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__\\ 에서 사용할 수 있습니다"

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:12
msgid "Enable notifications"
msgstr "알림 활성화"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:14
msgid ""
"From Mattermost mobile v2.34, the Mattermost **Settings > Notifications**"
" screen alerts you when notifications are disabled by your device. Follow"
" the link in the notification to enable device-level notifications."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 모바일 v2.34부터 OKR.BEST **설정 > 알림** 화면은 기기에서 알림이 "
"비활성화된 경우 이를 알려 줍니다. 알림의 링크를 따라가 기기 수준 알림을 "
"활성화하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:16
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v9.9, Mattermost prompts you to enable notifications in "
"the mobile app the first time you open the app."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST v9.9부터 OKR.BEST는 앱을 처음 열 때 모바일 앱에서 알림을 활성화하라는 "
"안내를 표시합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:18
msgid ""
"Once Mattermost notifications are enabled at the device level and in the "
"mobile app, you'll start receiving notifications for all Mattermost "
"activity with `badges <#badge-based-notifications>`__, and `push "
"notifications <#push-notifications>`__. See the section below on "
"`customizing your notifications <#customize-your-notifications>`__ based "
"on how you prefer to be notified about Mattermost activity on your mobile"
" device."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 알림이 기기 수준과 모바일 앱에서 활성화되면, 모든 OKR.BEST 활동에 "
"대해 `배지 <#badge-based-notifications>`__\\ 와 `푸시 알림 <#push-"
"notifications>`__\\ 으로 알림을 받기 시작합니다. 모바일 기기에서 OKR.BEST "
"활동에 대해 알림받기를 원하는 방식에 따라 `알림 사용자 지정 <#customize-your-"
"notifications>`__\\ 에 대한 아래 절을 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:22
msgid ""
"You may also need to enable notifications in iOS or Android for "
"Mattermost by changing your device preferences."
msgstr ""
"기기 환경설정을 변경해 iOS나 Android에서 OKR.BEST에 대한 알림을 활성화해야 할 "
"수도 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:25
msgid "Badge-based notifications"
msgstr "배지 기반 알림"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:27
msgid ""
"Mattermost mobile app icons display numbered badges for unread "
":ref:`direct <end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-types:direct message "
"channels>` and :ref:`group <end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-"
"types:group message channels>` messages, and :doc:`@mentions </end-user-"
"guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-keywords-notifications>`, "
":doc:`keywords </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-"
"keywords-notifications>` you're actively watching."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 모바일 앱 아이콘은 읽지 않은 :ref:`개인 <end-user-guide/collaborate"
"/channel-types:direct message channels>` 메시지와 :ref:`그룹 <end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/channel-types:group message channels>` 메시지, :doc:`@멘션 "
"</end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-keywords-"
"notifications>`, 적극적으로 지켜보는 :doc:`키워드 </end-user-"
"guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-keywords-notifications>`\\ 에 대한 "
"숫자 배지를 표시합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:29
msgid "|numbered-badge|"
msgstr "|numbered-badge|"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:7
msgid ""
"A numbered badge means you have at least 1 unread message, @mention, or "
"one of your keywords has triggered a notification."
msgstr ""
"숫자 배지는 읽지 않은 메시지나 @멘션이 1개 이상 있거나 키워드 중 하나가 알림을 "
"트리거했음을 의미합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:33
msgid ""
"The Mattermost mobile app doesn't display dot badges indicating other "
"unread activity by design. The activity you're directly involved in is "
"prioritized over other activity."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 모바일 앱은 설계상 다른 읽지 않은 활동을 나타내는 점 배지를 표시하지 "
"않습니다. 사용자가 직접 관여한 활동이 다른 활동보다 우선됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:34
msgid ""
"Android users may see Mattermost notifications in the Android "
"Notification Shade while the Mattermost icon shows no badge. This is "
"because the Android notification system may also display badges unread "
"activity."
msgstr ""
"Android 사용자는 OKR.BEST 아이콘에 배지가 없는데도 Android 알림 창에서 "
"OKR.BEST 알림을 볼 수 있습니다. 이는 Android 알림 시스템도 읽지 않은 활동에 "
"대한 배지를 표시할 수 있기 때문입니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:37
msgid "Push notifications"
msgstr "푸시 알림"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:39
msgid "You'll see mobile push notification messages on your device as follows:"
msgstr "기기에서 다음과 같이 모바일 푸시 알림 메시지를 보게 됩니다:"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:41
msgid ""
"**iOS**: On the Lock Screen, Notification Center, and as Banners/Alerts "
"based on your iOS settings."
msgstr ""
"**iOS**: iOS 설정에 따라 잠금 화면, 알림 센터, 배너/알림으로 표시됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:42
msgid ""
"**Android**: On the Lock Screen, Notification Shade, and as Banners"
"/Heads-Up Notifications based on your Android settings."
msgstr ""
"**Android**: Android 설정에 따라 잠금 화면, 알림 창, 배너/헤드업 알림으로 "
"표시됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:45
msgid "Customize your notifications"
msgstr "알림 사용자 지정"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:47
msgid ""
"You can manage your mobile notifications in both the desktop app and the "
"mobile app."
msgstr "모바일 알림은 데스크톱 앱과 모바일 앱 모두에서 관리할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:51
msgid ""
"In the desktop app, manage your mobile notification preferences by "
"selecting the **Settings** |gear| icon located in the top right corner of"
" the screen, and select **Notifications > Desktop and mobile "
"notifications**."
msgstr ""
"데스크톱 앱에서는 화면 오른쪽 위 모서리의 **Settings** |gear| 아이콘을 선택하고 "
"**Notifications > Desktop and mobile notifications**\\ 를 선택해 모바일 알림 "
"환경설정을 관리합니다."

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:47
msgid "Use the Settings icon to customize your Mattermost user experience."
msgstr "설정 아이콘을 사용해 OKR.BEST 사용자 경험을 사용자 지정합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:53
msgid ""
"By default, you receive mobile notifications for @mentions, direct "
"messages, and group messages when your Mattermost availability is "
":ref:`Online, Away, or Offline <end-user-guide/preferences/set-your-"
"status-availability:set your availability>`. You won't receive Mattermost"
" notifications on your device if you're actively using Mattermost in a "
"web browser."
msgstr ""
"기본적으로 OKR.BEST 접속 가능 여부가 :ref:`온라인, 자리 비움 또는 오프라인 "
"<end-user-guide/preferences/set-your-status-availability:set your "
"availability>`\\ 일 때 @멘션, 개인 메시지, 그룹 메시지에 대한 모바일 알림을 "
"받습니다. 웹 브라우저에서 OKR.BEST를 적극적으로 사용 중이면 기기에서 OKR.BEST "
"알림을 받지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:55
msgid ""
"Want to receive fewer mobile notifications? Under **Trigger mobile "
"notifications when I am**, select **Away or Offline** or **Offline**."
msgstr ""
"모바일 알림을 더 적게 받고 싶으신가요? **Trigger mobile notifications when I "
"am** 아래에서 **Away or Offline** 또는 **Offline**\\ 을 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:57
msgid ""
"Want different desktop and mobile notifications? Select **Use different "
"settings for my mobile devices**, and then select **All new messages**, "
"or **Mentions, direct messages and group messages**."
msgstr ""
"데스크톱과 모바일 알림을 다르게 설정하고 싶으신가요? **Use different settings "
"for my mobile devices**\\ 를 선택한 다음 **All new messages** 또는 "
"**Mentions, direct messages and group messages**\\ 를 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:61
msgid ""
"In the mobile app, tap your profile picture, then tap **Settings > "
"Notifications**."
msgstr ""
"모바일 앱에서는 프로필 사진을 탭한 다음 **Settings > Notifications**\\ 를 "
"탭합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:63
msgid ""
"Tap **Mentions** to disable notifications based on keywords that trigger "
"mentions, including first name, username, channel-wide @mentions, and "
"keywords you've specified."
msgstr ""
"**Mentions**\\ 를 탭해 이름, 사용자 ID, 채널 전체 @멘션, 지정한 키워드 등 "
"멘션을 트리거하는 키워드 기반 알림을 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:64
msgid "Tap **Push Notifications** to choose what to be notified about."
msgstr "**Push Notifications**\\ 를 탭해 무엇에 대해 알림을 받을지 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:66
msgid ""
"You can also :ref:`manage email notifications <end-user-guide/preferences"
"/manage-your-notifications:email notifications>` and :ref:`send automatic"
" replies to direct messages <end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-"
"thread-reply-notifications:send automatic replies to direct messages>` "
"directly from your device."
msgstr ""
"기기에서 직접 :ref:`이메일 알림을 관리 <end-user-guide/preferences/manage-"
"your-notifications:email notifications>`\\ 하고 :ref:`개인 메시지에 자동 답장을 "
"보낼 <end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-thread-reply-"
"notifications:send automatic replies to direct messages>` 수도 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:69
msgid "Incoming Call notifications"
msgstr "수신 통화 알림"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:71
msgid ""
"Want to hear a sound on your mobile device when a Mattermost call starts?"
" If your Mattermost admin :ref:`enables this Beta feature "
"<administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings:enable "
"call ringing>`, select **Call Notifications** to choose the sound that "
"plays when a call is started within a direct or group message you're "
"participating in."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 통화가 시작될 때 모바일 기기에서 소리를 듣고 싶으신가요? OKR.BEST "
"관리자가 :ref:`이 베타 기능을 활성화 <administration-guide/configure/plugins-"
"configuration-settings:enable call ringing>`\\ 하면, **Call "
"Notifications**\\ 를 선택해 참여 중인 개인 메시지나 그룹 메시지에서 통화가 "
"시작될 때 재생되는 소리를 선택할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:75
msgid ""
"From Mattermost mobile app v2.19, incoming call sounds also include "
"device vibration, as well as vibration-only when your device is in silent"
" mode."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 모바일 앱 v2.19부터 수신 통화 소리에는 기기 진동도 포함되며, 기기가 "
"무음 모드일 때는 진동만 울립니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:76
msgid ""
"If you prefer a separate call sound on mobile, your mobile change applies"
" only to your mobile device."
msgstr ""
"모바일에서 별도의 통화 소리를 사용하려는 경우, 모바일에서의 변경은 모바일 "
"기기에만 적용됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:79
msgid "Disable all mobile notifications"
msgstr "모든 모바일 알림 비활성화"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:81
msgid ""
"To disable all Mattermost mobile notifications, tap **Push Notifications "
"> Nothing**."
msgstr ""
"모든 OKR.BEST 모바일 알림을 비활성화하려면 **Push Notifications > "
"Nothing**\\ 을 탭합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:84
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "자주 묻는 질문"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:87
msgid "Are mobile notification counts the same as other Mattermost clients?"
msgstr "모바일 알림 개수는 다른 OKR.BEST 클라이언트와 동일한가요?"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:89
msgid ""
"No. You're only notified of unread threads with @mentions on your mobile "
"device. You're not notified of general unread activity on mobile."
msgstr ""
"아니요. 모바일 기기에서는 @멘션이 있는 읽지 않은 스레드에 대해서만 알림을 "
"받습니다. 모바일에서는 일반적인 읽지 않은 활동에 대해서는 알림을 받지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:92
msgid "What does a Mattermost icon with an exclamation point mean?"
msgstr "느낌표가 있는 OKR.BEST 아이콘은 무엇을 의미하나요?"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:94
msgid ""
"A Mattermost logo with an exclamation point means you're logged out of at"
" least 1 Mattermost server you connect to using the mobile app."
msgstr ""
"느낌표가 있는 OKR.BEST 로고는 모바일 앱으로 연결하는 OKR.BEST 서버 중 하나 "
"이상에서 로그아웃되었음을 의미합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications.rst:97
msgid ""
"A Mattermost icon with an exclamation point means that you're logged out "
"of at least 1 Mattermost server you connect to using the mobile app. Log "
"back in to any servers as needed. See the :doc:`Connect to multiple "
"workspaces </end-user-guide/preferences/connect-multiple-workspaces>` "
"documentation for details."
msgstr ""
"느낌표가 있는 OKR.BEST 아이콘은 모바일 앱으로 연결하는 OKR.BEST 서버 중 하나 "
"이상에서 로그아웃되었음을 의미합니다. 필요에 따라 서버에 다시 로그인하세요. "
"자세한 내용은 :doc:`여러 워크스페이스에 연결 </end-user-guide/preferences"
"/connect-multiple-workspaces>` 문서를 참고하세요."

